@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Product Consumption and Purchase API
	Testing Koroneiki Product Consumption and Purchase API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Automotive |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |

Scenario: Create and view product consumption with purchase
	Koroneiki product consumptions with a product purchase created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Purchase        | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	Then I should be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Product Purchase        | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Perpetual                        | true                                    |                |
	| Product Consumption Nested Field | Liferay Digital Experience Platform     |                |
	| Product Field and Value          | additionalProp1                         | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value          | additionalProp1                         | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value          | additionalProp2                         | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value          | additionalProp3                         | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                         | 1                                       |                |
	| Status                           | Approved                                |                |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "All" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Status                  | Approved           |                |
	And I should be able to view a product consumption made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| Product Purchase        | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |

Scenario: Create and view product consumption with purchase and start and end dates
	Koroneiki product consumptions with a product purchase with start and end dates created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Product Purchase        | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	Then I should be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Product Purchase        | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "All" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I should be able to view a product consumption made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Product Purchase        | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |

Scenario: Remove and view product consumption with purchase
	Koroneiki product consumptions with a product purchase removed via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Product Purchase        | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	And I delete a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	Then I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" via nested field with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Status                  | Approved           |                |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "All" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Status                  | Approved           |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" via the account api

Scenario: Remove and view product consumption with purchase and start and end dates
	Koroneiki product consumptions with a product purchase and start and end dates removed via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I create a product consumption for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Product Purchase        | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I delete a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	Then I should not be able to view a product consumption on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" via nested field with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Status                  | Approved           |                |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "All" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should be able to view a product purchase made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" under the "All" filter with the following values via the account api
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Status                  | Approved           |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product consumption made by "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" via the account api

